                <head>Enclosure</head>
                <p rendition="#center">DRAFT TEXT OF POSSIBLE ANNOUNCEMENT<anchor n="5"
                        xml:id="d306-f1"/></p>
                <p>The President of the United States and the Prime Minister of the United Kingdom
                    have felt that the time has come for the continuation of the personal
                    discussions which they held in Bermuda last March on the whole range of world
                    affairs. They have therefore agreed to meet in Washington on Wednesday October
                    23 in order to resume these personal talks.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
